{"anchor": "S1-P001", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 1, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "text": "# 一种用于低温催化的锰基氧化物研究（合成示例稿件）"}
{"anchor": "S1-P002", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 2, "char_start": 28, "char_end": 33, "text": "## 引言"}
{"anchor": "S1-P003", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 3, "char_start": 35, "char_end": 75, "text": "低温 CO 氧化是尾气净化的关键反应。已有研究表明锰基氧化物在室温附近具有活性。"}
{"anchor": "S1-P004", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 4, "char_start": 77, "char_end": 112, "text": "本文旨在开发一种高活性锰基催化剂。我们声称该催化剂优于所有已报道体系。"}
{"anchor": "S1-P005", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 5, "char_start": 114, "char_end": 119, "text": "## 方法"}
{"anchor": "S1-P006", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 6, "char_start": 121, "char_end": 184, "text": "采用共沉淀法制备 MnOx 样品，于 400 C 焙烧 4 h。以固定床反应器评价 CO 氧化活性，空速 30000 h-1。"}
{"anchor": "S1-P007", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 7, "char_start": 186, "char_end": 191, "text": "## 结果"}
{"anchor": "S1-P008", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 8, "char_start": 193, "char_end": 245, "text": "样品 A 在 25 C 实现 50% CO 转化率。样品 B 在 25 C 实现 90% CO 转化率。"}
{"anchor": "S1-P009", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 9, "char_start": 247, "char_end": 299, "text": "样品 A 在 25 C 实现 50% CO 转化率。样品 B 在 25 C 实现 90% CO 转化率。"}
{"anchor": "S1-P010", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 10, "char_start": 301, "char_end": 323, "text": "图 1 给出两个样品的转化率随温度变化曲线。"}
{"anchor": "S1-P011", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 11, "char_start": 325, "char_end": 330, "text": "## 结论"}
{"anchor": "S1-P012", "source": "S1", "file": "manuscript.md", "para_index": 12, "char_start": 332, "char_end": 367, "text": "样品 B 是最优催化剂。该体系可直接用于工业尾气处理，无需进一步优化。"}
